SUMMARY:Village Dance Davis
DESCRIPTION:Village Dance – Summer Edition\nThursday\, July 23\, 2026 | 6:30pm – 9:30pm \nVets Memorial\, 203 14th St.\, Davis\, CA \nVillage Dance is a space for our community to show up as we are and to move through the range of life experiences that we carry. The invitation is always to be in your body in the co-created space as we collectively move through the journey-like music. It’s an embodiment/somatic practice. \nThis month is particularly special\, as we have NDEMIK\, our resident DJ and co-creator of Village Dance. NDEMIK brings thoughtfully constructed sets that weave together a variety of musical genres. \nStay updated on all things Village Dance on our instagram – @villagedancedavis\nSchedule: \n6:30pm – Doors Open\n6:45pm – Opening Circle and Embodiment Workshop with Clover\n7:15pm – Dance Journey with NDEMIK\n9:00pm – Closing Circle \nGet your tickets in advance here
URL:https://thedirt.online/event/village-dance-davis/
LOCATION:Davis Veterans Memorial Center\, 203 East 14th Street\, Davis\, CA\, 95616
CATEGORIES:Community,Music,Stage & Dance
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://thedirt.online/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/VDlogo.png
ORGANIZER;CN="Village Dance Davis":MAILTO:dmoglen@gmail.com
END:VEVENT
